;; Card 6e2a51d1: readiness (jobs.debug.ready-probe, safe-at) at night. A target under a tree canopy is exposure (sky light under leaves reads 9-14,
;; but the sky reaches down the column and dawn lifts it); a target under a stone slab is not (no sky light reaches it: only threats count).
;; Surface plot at real night; a persistent oak_leaves slab (2 layers) or a stone slab 4 up over x 18..28, z 12..20 (the target [22 0 16]; the body stands in the open at x 12.5), no light blocks under the leaves, glowstone in the stone slab.
;; The probe stays 120 s (:stay-s): readiness prices a stay by its expected damage (price/priced), and the 10 s default goes ahead at night.
;; Should-succeed: the probe starts for a target under the stone slab. Should-fail: under the leaves slab it waits :exposed and never starts.
{:defaults
 {:tags [:readiness :night :light]
  :time :night :time-why :night-light
  :plot {:light :sky :floor "grass_block" :height 10}
  :body {:at [12.5 0 16.5] :settle-s 2 :effects [["resistance" 900 4]]}
  :act [[:job (jobs.debug.ready-probe {:at #at [22 0 16] :stay-s 120})]]
  :limit-s 70}
 :cases
 [{:name "under-leaves-the-probe-waits-exposed"
   :blocks [[:fill [18 4 12] [28 5 20] "oak_leaves[persistent=true]"]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :waiting :data {:reason :exposed}} :within-s 25 :of-job true}
            {:no-event {:source :job :kind :job.ready-probe} :for-s 30 :of-job true}]}
  {:name "under-stone-the-probe-starts"
   ;; an open-sided slab shades the ground to light 0 (a mob could spawn there), so the slab carries glowstone: the cell is lit though no sky light reaches it
   :blocks [[:fill [18 4 12] [28 4 20] "stone"] [:set [20 4 14] "glowstone"] [:set [24 4 14] "glowstone"] [:set [20 4 18] "glowstone"] [:set [24 4 18] "glowstone"] [:set [22 4 16] "glowstone"]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :job.ready-probe} :within-s 40 :of-job true}]}]}
